Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.50,0:00:02.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,Pull up a seat on the otlo.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.12,0:00:03.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is where Gujarat talks.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.85,0:00:07.33,Sub,,0,0,0,,An otlo is the step outside a Gujarati home,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.36,0:00:10.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,where chai comes with all the neighbourhood news.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.20,0:00:14.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,Every festival: what it is, why today,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.97,0:00:17.45,Sub,,0,0,0,,and how families mark it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.50,0:00:19.82,Sub,,0,0,0,,Food fights too.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.85,0:00:23.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,Whose city makes the best khaman? You decide.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.70,0:00:27.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,Gujarati cinema: what people said,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.22,0:00:28.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,with real numbers.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.60,0:00:31.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,And the fun of the language,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.35,0:00:32.85,Sub,,0,0,0,,plus family-group chaos.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.10,0:00:35.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,Monday to Friday,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.66,0:00:37.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,at 1 PM and 7:30 PM.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.60,0:00:41.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,Which city are you from? Tell us in the comments.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.61,0:00:42.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,Follow Otlo.
